msgid "Redirects"
msgstr "重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:4
msgid ""
"Over time, a documentation project may want to rename and move contents "
"around. Redirects allow changes in a documentation project to happen without"
" bad user experiences."
msgstr "随着时间推移，文档项目可能需要重命名和移动内容。重定向让文档项目的变更不会造成糟糕的用户体验。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you do not manage URL structures, users will eventually encounter 404 "
"File Not Found errors. While this may be acceptable in some cases, the bad "
"user experience of a 404 page is usually best to avoid."
msgstr "若不管理 URL 结构，用户最终会遇到 404 File Not Found 错误。某些情况下这或许可以接受，但 404 页面带来的糟糕体验通常最好避免。"

