#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:28
msgid "Built-in redirects"
msgstr "内置重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:30
msgid ""
"This section explains the redirects that are automatically active for all "
"projects and how they are useful. Built-in redirects are especially useful "
"for creating and sharing incoming links, which is discussed in depth in "
":doc:`/guides/best-practice/links`."
msgstr ""
"本节讲解对所有项目自动生效的重定向及其用途。内置重定向对创建和分享入站链接尤为有用，详见 :doc:`/guides/best-"
"practice/links` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:37
msgid "Page redirects at ``/page/``"
msgstr "``/page/`` 处的页面重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:39
msgid ""
"You can link to a specific page and have it redirect to your default "
"version, allowing you to create links on external sources that are always up"
" to date. This is done with the ``/page/`` URL prefix."
msgstr "你可以链接到特定页面并让其重定向到默认版本，从而在外部来源创建始终最新的链接。这通过 ``/page/`` URL 前缀实现。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:43
msgid ""
"For instance, you can reach the page you are reading now by going to "
"https://docs.readthedocs.io/page/guides/best-practice/links.html."
msgstr ""
"例如，你可以通过 https://docs.readthedocs.io/page/guides/best-practice/links.html "
"访问当前阅读的页面。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:45
msgid ""
"Another way to handle this is the ``latest`` version. You can set your "
"``latest`` version to a specific version and just always link to ``latest``."
" You can reach this page by going to "
"https://docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/guides/best-practice/links.html."
msgstr ""
"另一种处理方式是使用 ``latest`` 版本。你可以把 ``latest`` 版本设为某个特定版本，然后始终链接到 ``latest`` "
"。你可以通过 https://docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/guides/best-practice/links.html"
" 访问该页面。"

