msgstr "指向文档根目录（`<slug>.readthedocs.io/`）的链接会重定向到项目设置中指定的 :term:`default version` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:57
msgid ""
"This works for both readthedocs.io (|org_brand|), readthedocs-hosted.com "
"(|com_brand|), and :doc:`custom domains </custom-domains>`."
msgstr ""
"该功能对 readthedocs.io（|org_brand|）、readthedocs-hosted.com（|com_brand|）和 "
":doc:`自定义域名 </custom-domains>` 均有效。"

