#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:70
msgid ""
"You can choose which is the :term:`default version` for Read the Docs to "
"display. This usually corresponds to the most recent official release from "
"your project."
msgstr "你可以选择 Read the Docs 展示哪个 :term:`default version` 。它通常对应你项目最近的正式发布版本。"

