#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:95
msgid "User-defined redirects"
msgstr "用户自定义重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:98
msgid "Page redirects"
msgstr "页面重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:100
msgid ""
"*Page Redirects* let you redirect a page across all versions of your "
"documentation."
msgstr "*页面重定向* 让你能在文档的所有版本间重定向某个页面。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:104
msgid ""
"Since page redirects apply to all versions of a project, ``From URL`` "
"doesn't need to include the ``/<language>/<version>`` prefix (for example, "
"``/en/latest``), only the path to the page. Page redirects don't apply to "
"translations or subprojects, which need their own redirect rules. If you "
"need a redirect for a specific language or version URL, use :ref:`user-"
"defined-redirects:exact redirects` with the fully-specified path."
msgstr ""
"由于页面重定向适用于项目的所有版本，``From URL`` 无需包含 ``/<language>/<version>`` 前缀（例如 "
"``/en/latest`` ），只需提供页面路径。页面重定向不适用于翻译或子项目，它们需要各自的重定向规则。若需要针对特定语言或版本的 URL "
"重定向，请使用 :ref:`user-defined-redirects:exact redirects` 并给出完整路径。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:113
msgid "Exact redirects"
msgstr "精确重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:115
msgid ""
"*Exact Redirects* take into account the full URL (including language and "
"version), allowing you to create a redirect for a specific version or "
"language of your documentation."
msgstr "*精确重定向* 考虑完整 URL（含语言和版本），让你能为文档的特定版本或语言创建重定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:119
msgid "Clean/HTML URLs redirects"
msgstr "简洁/HTML URL 重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:121
msgid ""
"If you decide to change the style of the URLs of your documentation, you can"
" use *Clean URL to HTML* or *HTML to clean URL* redirects to redirect users "
"to the new URL style."
msgstr ""
"若决定更改文档的 URL 风格，可使用 *Clean URL to HTML* 或 *HTML to clean URL* 重定向将用户导向新的 URL"
" 风格。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:124
msgid ""
"For example, if a previous page was at ``/en/latest/install.html``, and now "
"is served at ``/en/latest/install/``, or vice versa, users will be "
"redirected to the new URL."
msgstr ""
"例如，若之前页面位于 ``/en/latest/install.html`` ，现在改为在 ``/en/latest/install/`` "
"提供（或反之），用户将被重定向到新 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:129
msgid "Limitations and observations"
msgstr "限制与说明"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:131
msgid ""
"|org_brand| users are limited to 100 redirects per project, and |com_brand| "
"users have a number of redirects limited by their plan."
msgstr "|org_brand| 用户每个项目限 100 条重定向，|com_brand| 用户的重定向数量受套餐限制。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:133
msgid ""
"By default, redirects only apply on pages that don't exist. **Forced "
"redirects** allow you to apply redirects on existing pages."
msgstr "默认情况下，重定向仅对不存在的页面生效。**强制重定向** 让你能在已存在的页面上应用重定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:135
msgid ""
"Redirects aren't applied on :doc:`previews of pull requests </pull-"
"requests>`. You should treat these domains as ephemeral and not rely on them"
" for user-facing content."
msgstr ""
"重定向不会在 :doc:`Pull Request 预览 </pull-requests>` "
"上生效。应将这些域名视为临时性的，不要依赖它们承载面向用户的内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:137
msgid ""
"You can redirect to URLs outside Read the Docs, just include the protocol in"
" ``To URL``, e.g ``https://example.com``."
msgstr ""
"你可以重定向到 Read the Docs 之外的 URL，只需在 ``To URL`` 中包含协议，例如 "
"``https://example.com`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:139
msgid ""
"A wildcard can be used at the end of ``From URL`` (suffix wildcard) to "
"redirect all pages matching a prefix. Prefix and infix wildcards are not "
"supported."
msgstr "可在 ``From URL`` 末尾使用通配符（后缀通配符）重定向所有匹配某前缀的页面。不支持前缀和中间通配符。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:141
msgid ""
"If a wildcard is used in ``From URL``, the part of the URL that matches the "
"wildcard can be used in ``To URL`` with the ``:splat`` placeholder."
msgstr "若 ``From URL`` 中使用了通配符，URL 中匹配通配符的部分可在 ``To URL`` 中用 ``:splat`` 占位符引用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:143
msgid ""
"Redirects without a wildcard match paths with or without a trailing slash, "
"e.g. ``/install`` matches ``/install`` and ``/install/``."
msgstr "不含通配符的重定向会匹配带或不带尾部斜杠的路径，例如 ``/install`` 同时匹配 ``/install`` 和 ``/install/`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:145
msgid ""
"The order of redirects matters. If multiple redirects match the same URL, "
"the first one will be applied. The order of redirects :ref:`can be changed "
"from your project's dashboard <guides/redirects:Changing the order of "
"redirects>`."
msgstr ""
"重定向顺序很重要。若多条重定向匹配同一 URL，将应用第一条。重定向顺序 :ref:`可在项目仪表盘中调整 "
"<guides/redirects:Changing the order of redirects>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:149
msgid ""
"If an infinite redirect is detected, a 404 error will be returned, and no "
"other redirects will be applied."
msgstr "若检测到无限重定向，将返回 404 错误，且不再应用其他重定向。"

